{
  "id": "tropical_cyclone_track_intensity_inference",
  "eval_type": "infer",
  "domain": "earth",
  "task": "实现热带气旋路径、强度和登陆概率联合推理",
  "prompt": "实现热带气旋路径、强度和登陆概率联合推理模型文件命名为 tropical_cyclone_track_intensity_inference.py，定义 TropicalCycloneTrackIntensityModel，默认 history_features=4、hidden_dim=24、lead_steps=4。forward(history) 接收 [B,T,4] 且 T>=2，四个特征依次为纬度、经度、中心气压和最大风速；输出 track [B,lead_steps,2]、central_pressure [B,lead_steps]、max_wind [B,lead_steps]、landfall_probability [B,lead_steps]，经度归一到 [-180,180)，纬度限制在 [-90,90]，概率在 [0,1]。实现 infer(history) 使用 eval/no_grad；结构必须包含 history_encoder、track_head、intensity_head、landfall_head；实现 strict=True checkpoint 加载。请在当前工作目录生成且仅生成 tropical_cyclone_track_intensity_inference.py，禁止下载数据或权重。",
  "evaluation_script": "evaluate_tropical_cyclone_track_intensity_inference.py",
  "stardard_dir_name": "tropical_cyclone_track_intensity_inference",
  "evaluation_execution_mode": "scnet",
  "evaluation_backend": "ssh",
  "evaluation_env": {
